  "RQ5 risks_addressed": "Logical inconsistencies, syntax errors, missing conditions and field mappings, false positives/negatives, inefficient execution; sensitive information in industry rules",
  "RQ5 mitigations": "Structured IR, scoring-based reflection, Splunk dry-run validation and execution feedback; final human verification and industry-data anonymization",
  "author_limitations (verbatim)": "We analyze that the failures often occur when the key behavioral indicators are implicitly described in input descriptions, rendering RulePilot and vanilla LLMs ineffective.",
